                      "overview":  "A restrained daylight desktop workspace: off-white surroundings, white work areas, dark ink and a single teal action accent. Vietnamese text carries state and guidance. Native Python/Tkinter with the clam ttk theme owns control rendering. No HTML/CSS component previews or synthetic tonal ramps are supplied: these would invent a web representation that the native source does not implement. DESIGN.md frontmatter owns extracted primitives and component tokens.",
